{"availability":"available","full":"theopensystemslab/map","name":"map","description":"Web components for tasks related to addresses and planning permission in the UK","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":17,"forks":1,"created":"2021-07-14T09:55:40Z","updated":"2026-10-01T14:27:11Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://oslmap.netlify.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://oslmap.netlify.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:05:54.299Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T05:05:54.299Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T05:05:54.299Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:05.322Z","stars":17,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-16T05:05:54.299Z","stars":17,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A library of Web Components for tasks related to addresses and planning permission in the UK built with Lit, Vite, and Ordnance Survey APIs.","is an OpenLayers-powered map to support drawing and modifying red-line boundaries. Other supported modes include: highlighting an OS Feature that intersects with a given address point; clicking to select and merge multiple OS Features into a single boundary; and displaying static point or polygon data. Events are dispatched with the calculated area and geojson representation when you change your drawing.","is a GOV.UK-styled input that validates UK postcodes using these utility methods. When a postcode is validated, an event is dispatched containing the sanitized string."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/theopensystemslab/map/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1360064f6b7b19d7bbbc41deec21c11aa0d2c7328c285c88a6e072c3b905d2a1","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:05.440Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:05.440Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A library of Web Components for tasks related to addresses and planning permission in the UK built with Lit, Vite, and Ordnance Survey APIs.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/theope